sVWhat information do we collect and how do we use it?
p21
I1
sVConsumers may provide us with some personal information, including names, email addresses, phone numbers, zip codes, and birthday, when they sign up for our programs.
p22
I1
sVWe collect information that is voluntarily provided by you through any of the methods listed in this Privacy Notice.
p23
I1
sVGreat Clips will not use or share individual information provided to us in ways incompatible with those described above, and we do not sell, for monetary consideration, your individual information to anyone.
p24
I2
sVWe may also collect information that is related to you but that does not personally identify you (\u201cNon-personal Information\u201d). Non-personal Information also includes information that could personally identify you in its original form but that we have modified (for instance, by aggregating, anonymizing, or de-identifying such information) in order to remove or hide any personally identifying information.
p25
I1
sVThe Site may also collect information about technology interface preferences (such as the type of browser or device used, or the files requested) to improve the Site and better meet your needs.
p26
I1
sVWe collect basic information about our customers in order to provide services to them, to conduct business or customer service, for legal compliance, for marketing and promotional initiatives, and for research and analytical purposes, including but not limited to:
p27
I1
sVGreat Clips may share this information with any franchisees, subsidiaries, licensees, affiliates, assigns, successors, or other respective owners.
p28
I1
sVPlease note that we may be unable to identify your Personal Information and verify your identity, including for, but not limited to, the following reasons: (1) you have provided different spellings of your name or you operated under a different name at any point in your interactions with Great Clips, (2) you moved or changed your phone number without having your information updated, (3) you don\u2019t respond to the verification email (please be sure to check your junk or spam folders), or (4) we have reason to suspect the request being made is with mal-intent or otherwise fraudulent in nature.
p29
I1
sVOur Site and App are not designed for children, and we do not collect information online from any person we know is under the age of 18.
p30
I2
sVWhile we work hard to ensure we use and disclose our customers\u2019 individual information only for the purposes identified in this Privacy Notice, customers can choose not to provide individual information or limit the individual information obtained by us.
p31
I1
sVWe will not collect a category of Personal Information not listed above, or use any Personal Information collected in any of the above categories for a business purpose not listed above, without first providing you with notice.
p32
I1
sVTo the extent that applicable law requires express consent, express written consent, or \u201copt-in\u201d for the collection and use of certain types of individual information, Great Clips will maintain processes and procedures to ensure such information is collected with express consent.
p33
I1
sVWe do not knowingly sell or share the Personal Information of minors who are under 16 years old without their consent or minors who are under 13 years old unless a parent or guardian of that minor affirmatively authorizes the sale or sharing of that Personal Information through one of the following methods:
